# Risks, Assumptions and Dependencies – Payment Feature

## Risks

1. Payment Failure
–Payment may fail.

2. Duplicate Payment
– User may be charged two time .

 Assumptions

1. Payment Gateway is Available 
– We assume the payment gateway is working.

2. Test Payment Details are Available 
– We assume test cards or UPI are available.

Dependencies

1. Payment Gateway 
– Testing depends on the payment gateway.

2. Order Module
– Payment depends on the order being created correctly.

 Conclusion

Risks are possible problems, assumptions are things we expect to be available, and dependencies are things required for testing.
